<title>NETHERLANDS: BATENBURG 1996 PROVISIONAL NET SEEN UP.</title>
<headline>BATENBURG 1996 PROVISIONAL NET SEEN UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     8.2  vs   7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     197    vs 168</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler and engineering group Batenburg</p>
<p>Beheer NV said it will publish its full 1996 results and</p>
<p>dividend proposal on April 3.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
